  "generated_text": "1. **Identify the total number of arrangements:**\n   The total number of arrangements of 5 tiles is given by the factorial of 5, which is $5! = 120$.\n\n2. **Identify the number of favorable arrangements:**\n   There is only one arrangement \"XOXOX\" that satisfies the condition.\n\n3. **Calculate the probability:**\n   The probability is the ratio of the number of favorable arrangements to the total number of arrangements:\n   \\[\n   \\text{Probability} = \\frac{1}{120} = \\frac{1}{120}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Box the final answer:**\n   The probability that the arrangement reads XOXOX is $\\boxed{\\frac{1}{120}}$.",
